(7649087, 1243937, 3306, '<td valign="top">When I saw your entry I felt it had a lot of potential, but I had sensed as you have stated that it needed more devotion! Still a worthy entry in minimal editing. Congrats on 5th!</td>', 'When I saw your entry I felt it had a lot of potential, but I had sensed as you have stated that it needed more devotion! Still a worthy entry in minimal editing. Congrats on 5th!', '2019-12-28 08:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
