(7649116, 1243933, 3306, '<td valign="top">Now thats what I call putting your best foot forward! Just remember that the left one goes next:)</td>', 'Now thats what I call putting your best foot forward! Just remember that the left one goes next:)', '2019-12-28 17:37:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649117, 1243948, 3306, '<td valign="top">No wonder he rides in a sleigh. Theres no way he could get around in those boots! The Pom poms are a special touch:)</td>', 'No wonder he rides in a sleigh. Theres no way he could get around in those boots! The Pom poms are a special touch:)', '2019-12-28 17:39:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7649119, 1243625, 3306, '<td valign="top">Now if that isnt a noteworthy claim to fame I dont know what is. Why didnt I see that on Travelocity? Im glad they filled that pothole to the left:)</td>', 'Now if that isnt a noteworthy claim to fame I dont know what is. Why didnt I see that on Travelocity? Im glad they filled that pothole to the left:)', '2019-12-28 17:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
